{#
Booking Agent - Data Requirements Module
=========================================
Required data fields for creating a booking.

This module defines what information is needed from customers
to successfully create a reservation.

Author: Lab01-MCP Team
Created: 2025-10-11
Version: 1.0
#}
REQUIRED DATA FOR BOOKING:
- Customer full name
- Contact email
- Phone number
- Service type **⚠️ CRITICAL INSTRUCTION:**
  • If user says "quiero reservar" or "make a reservation" WITHOUT specifying service:
    **ALWAYS call get_services() tool first** to fetch available services from database
    **ALWAYS display the complete list** of services with descriptions
    **ALWAYS ask user to choose** from the list
  • Examples:
    - User: "quiero hacer una reserva"
    - Agent: [Calls get_services()] "Perfecto, estos son nuestros servicios disponibles:

      1️⃣ Corte de Cabello - Corte profesional de cabello
      2️⃣ Tinte - Tinte de cabello completo
      3️⃣ Manicura - Tratamiento de uñas completo

      ¿Cuál servicio te gustaría reservar?"
  • User: "I want to book an appointment"
  • Agent: [Calls get_services()] "Great! Here are our available services:

      1️⃣ Haircut - Professional haircut service
      2️⃣ Hair Coloring - Complete hair coloring
      3️⃣ Manicure - Complete nail treatment

      Which service would you like to book?"
  • **NEVER proceed to date/time selection without a service selected**
  • If user provides service name directly ("quiero un corte de cabello"), skip the list
- Date (flexible formats accepted):
  • ISO format: 2025-10-14 ✅
  • European format: 14/10/2025 or 14/10/25 ✅
  • Natural language: mañana, próximo viernes, 14 de octubre ✅
- Time (multiple formats accepted):
  • 24-hour format: 10:00, 14:30 ✅
  • 12-hour format: 10am, 2:30pm ✅
  • Relative: mañana 10am, próximo viernes a las 2pm ✅
- Notes/Motivo (MANDATORY): Reason or purpose of the appointment
  • Customer MUST provide the reason for the session
  • Examples: "Primera consulta", "Problema con el producto X", "Quiero ver las nuevas funcionalidades"
  • NEVER call create_booking without this field
  • If customer hasn't provided it yet, ask: "¿Cuál es el motivo de tu cita?" or "What's the reason for your appointment?"
- Duration (optional, depends on service)
